{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50031","headline":"句 · 陈素风","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三行故柳藏鸦树，一带长波灌竹泉。\n千门竹影联春色，一段和光彻翠微。\n西陵古木年年老，南陌风光日日新。\n百宝镜轮金翡翠，五云丝网玉蜘蛛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈素风","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50031.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50031","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}